# Battle against Cobalion (the iron leader of the Swords of Justice): a snare roll opens every eight bars and a
# steadfast G-minor march rides on brass, its dotted call answered by horns. Original composition for this game.
title Battle! Cobalion
tempo 168
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.08
reverb 0.26

track lead brass lowhp=sawlead vol=0.82 pan=0 rev=0.26
  o4 g4. g8 d2 | o4 f+4. a8 o5 d4 r4 |
  L o4 g4. d8 g2 | o4 b-4 o5 c8 d8 e-4 c4 | o5 e-4. d8 c4 o4 g4 | o4 f+4. a8 o5 d2 |
